5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,Let's get straight to the point. We need a plan to find the wolf quickly. I suggest we watch for anyone who seems too eager to deflect suspicion.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,"A measured approach is best, Takumi. I shall observe from the sidelines and see how the group's dynamics evolve.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm so happy to be playing with everyone! Let's all be honest and friendly, and I'm sure we'll find the werewolf together!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree with George. Observation is the most reliable tool we have right now. I'll be keeping a close eye on the conversation.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Rin,,This is so exciting! It's like a real mystery! I'm going to use my super-detective skills to catch the wolf! Hehe!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Yumi, being friendly is nice, but remember the wolf will act friendly too. We can't let our guard down just because someone is smiling.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,Takumi is right. Kindness can be a very effective mask in a game of deception.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Takumi, you're so serious! But I understand. I'll try to be helpful while staying alert!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"It is a delicate balance. We must maintain trust to cooperate, but skepticism to survive.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, don't be so grumpy! But I'll be watching for ""fake"" smiles too! I'm a pro at this!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not grumpy, I'm being realistic. @George, since you're observing, do you have any initial impressions of anyone?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"It is far too early for impressions, Takumi. I prefer to gather more data before forming a conclusion.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,I think everyone seems lovely so far! Maybe the wolf is just really nervous?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"Nervousness can be faked, Yumi. I'm more interested in who tries to steer the narrative too early.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Rin,,"Ooh, steering the narrative! That sounds like a fancy detective word! I'll look for that!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"Fair enough. Let's end the day here and see what the Seer finds tonight. Stay sharp, everyone.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,George,,I concur. I shall retire for the evening. Good night.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Yumi,,Good night everyone! Sweet dreams! I hope the Seer finds a big clue!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Misaki,,Good night. I'll be reflecting on today's talk.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Rin,,Bye-bye! I'm going to dream about catching the wolf in a big net!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
