32,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I have information. I am the Seer, and I divined Yumi. She is the werewolf.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,George,,"That is a very bold claim to make so early, Takumi. Are you certain you wish to reveal yourself now?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"What?! No way! Takumi, why would you say that? I'm just a regular human! I'm so sad you'd lie about me!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"A Seer revealing themselves on Day 1 is a high-risk strategy. It could be the truth, or a wolf trying to frame Yumi.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Rin,,Whoa! A wolf already?! This is moving so fast! Is Yumi really the bad guy? I can't believe it!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm certain. I don't see the point in hiding when I've already found the target. We should execute Yumi now.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,George,,"@Yumi, how do you respond to this accusation beyond your emotional appeal?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@George, I don't have a ""response"" because I'm innocent! Takumi is just trying to trick everyone into trusting him!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, if you are the wolf, claiming the Seer role and targeting Yumi is a clever way to gain immediate control.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Yumi, you're acting really sad, but maybe that's the ""fake smile"" we talked about! Hehe!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki, if I were the wolf, I'd pick a target who is less likely to be defended. Yumi's ""innocence"" is her only shield.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,George,,"The logic is consistent, but the risk of executing a villager is high. However, a confirmed werewolf is too valuable to ignore.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Yumi,,Please don't believe him! I've been nothing but nice to everyone! Why would I be the wolf?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"Being nice is not evidence of humanity. However, Takumi's eagerness is also a point of interest.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Rin,,I trust Takumi! He's brave and doesn't give up! I think he's telling the truth!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Let's vote. The evidence is clear from my divination.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,George,,I will follow the Seer's lead in this instance.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"This is so unfair! I'm not the wolf! Please, please don't vote for me!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"I will vote based on the claim, though I remain cautious of the Seer's identity.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm voting for Yumi! Sorry Yumi, but the detective work says you're the wolf!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
